{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00767","headline":"舞曲歌辞 中和乐舞词 · 不详","name":"舞曲歌辞 中和乐舞词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳岁肇佳节，物华当仲春。\n乾坤既昭泰，烟景含氤氲。\n德浅荷玄贶，乐成思治人。\n前庭列钟鼓，广殿延羣臣。\n八卦随舞意，五音转曲新。\n顾非咸池奏，庶协南风薰。\n式宴礼所重，浃欢情必均。\n同和谅在兹，万国希可亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00767.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00767","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}